# Cloudflare Tunnel token for the stock-select tunnel.
#
# 1. Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard -> Networks -> Tunnels -> Create a tunnel
#    (Cloudflared type). Copy the tunnel TOKEN it shows.
# 2. Add a Public Hostname on that tunnel, e.g.
#       stockselect.lwongkll-trading.com  ->  HTTP  ->  web:80
#    (service host "web" resolves via the compose extra_hosts pin).
# 3. Zero Trust -> Access -> Applications -> add a self-hosted app for that
#    hostname with an email-OTP policy allowing lwongkll@gmail.com (Milestone C).
# 4. Copy this file to  docker/.env  and paste the token below. Never commit it.

TUNNEL_TOKEN=
